# Copy to .dev.vars for local work (wrangler dev reads it; it's not committed).
# dev: /auth/login signs you in as a local "Dev" account, on localhost only.
AUTH_MODE=dev
# Or, with a Battle.net client from https://develop.battle.net/access/clients
# (redirect URL http://localhost:8787/auth/callback):
# AUTH_MODE=battlenet
# BNET_CLIENT_ID=
# BNET_CLIENT_SECRET=
